# 8. LangGraph — orchestration primitive

`https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph`

LangGraph's strongest capabilities for us are durable execution, state persistence and human-in-the-loop interruption/resumption. ([GitHub][8])

This allows:

```text
Research
   ↓
Claims extraction
   ↓
Script
   ↓
Verifier
   ↓
   ◇ quality > threshold?
  / \
yes  no
