# Architecture decision: use Temporal first

Because our Postiz deployment already has:

```text
Temporal
```

running, make **Temporal the durable production workflow backbone**.

Then agent implementations can be anything:

```text
Python agents
Claude/Codex CLI
LangGraph agent
OpenAI API
local model
external script
```

but all report back through one agent adapter.

Eventually LangGraph could run *inside a Temporal activity* when an individual agent needs complex stateful reasoning.

Thus:

```text
Temporal
    │
    ├── media workflow
    │
    ├── publishing workflow
    │
    └── agent workflow
             │
             ↓
          LangGraph
          optional
```

Not:

```text
Temporal fights LangGraph fights Celery fights BullMQ
```

