Do **not** spend time rebuilding:

```text
OAuth
social-provider clients
LLM trace visualization
generic prompt management
generic agent graph visualization
generic scheduling
generic media upload
```

Existing projects are already strong there. ([GitHub][4])

Build the unique layer:

```text
CONTENT ↔ FEATURES ↔ PUBLICATIONS ↔ ANALYTICS ↔ AGENT DECISIONS
```

That's the novel part.

