The important conceptual shift is that we're no longer making a social-media scheduler. **We're making the operating system for an autonomous multi-brand media network.** Postiz becomes the reliable social I/O subsystem; analytics supplies feedback; agents perform work; Temporal coordinates them; Langfuse explains what the agents did; and the control panel gives you one place to supervise the entire factory.

